    OPERATIONS → {F:1, M:1}
    RISK       → {F:2, M:1}
    TRADING    → {F:1, M:2}

  ═══ PARTITIONING (binary) ═══
  10 employees ──partitioningBy(isMale, counting())──→ {true:5, false:5}
